[PrintTextModified Text:审判结束后。<br>我来到奈叶香和玛格的房间。|#0202Adv21_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（你们两个，都已经不在了）|#0202Adv21_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无力地拿出自己的手机。|#0202Adv21_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:打算看看奈叶香被处刑前发给我的消息。<br>|#0202Adv21_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我打开她发来的消息。|#0202Adv21_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:里面好像还附带了一份录像。<br>|#0202Adv21_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香……你究竟想告诉我什么？）|#0202Adv21_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

