@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Default MakeDefault:true HideOther:true

[PrintTextModified Text:录像就此结束。|#0202Adv21_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:……真是段任性的遗言。|#0202Adv21_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我用颤抖的声音抱怨道，咬紧嘴唇。|#0202Adv21_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果我选择和奈叶香结盟，<br>而不是刻意和她保持距离——|#0202Adv21_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许我们会拥有完全不同的未来。|#0202Adv21_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

